sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Ingredient as Ingredient
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Ingredient: reinstate()
    Note over Ingredient: Policies: ingredientRead, ingredientWrite, ingredientExecute
    Note over Ingredient: Guards (3)
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;discontinued#quot;
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;kitchenManageAccess#quot;)
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.status
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.discontinuedAt
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.discontinuationReason
    Ingredient->>EventBus: emit IngredientReinstated on ingredient.reinstated
    Ingredient-->>-Client: void